From f1237f12ac6920e19a0e9b900f185ff4879ee416 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Arena Agent <dev@arena.ai>
Date: Mon, 31 Aug 2026 22:42:06 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] fix(trades): remove demo on real trade + prevent Enter
 auto-submit

Two bugs after the DB was set up:
1. Registering a real trade still showed the seeded demo trades next to
   it. Now POST /api/trades deletes demo trades when a non-demo trade is
   created, so the journal only shows real operations.
2. The trade form auto-submitted when pressing Enter in any field (default
   HTML form behavior), saving the operation before the user finished
   filling in the Result & Journal step. Added onKeyDown to the form to
   block Enter submission (except on textareas / buttons).

Also include the initial Drizzle migration (creates trades, config,
macro_cards, daily_bias) + db scripts and a cleaned .gitignore so the
database tables are versioned.
